        "@value": "From Lima, Peru, Novalima fuses traditional Afro-Peruvian rhythms with electronic, dub, reggae, salsa, and global beats. With six acclaimed albums, a Latin Grammy nomination and multiple performances at top festivals [&hellip;]"
      }
    ],
