        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Screen Printing - Paper Printmaking Series with Yaimel López - VLACC"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join Yaimel Lopez for this exciting introductory screen printing program. Students will learn to make stencils and use them to create compositions and typography. They will continue on their skills over the weeks to create posters, and prints. Yaimel also likes to show how these illustrations can be made into animations and he shares his teachings throughout the weeks. Materials cost included in the fees."
      }
    ],
