        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "ART TALK | DIASPORAS – Latin American Artists in Canada  - VLACC"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us on November 24th for another exciting visual arts talk. To what degree are the practices of contemporary artists born in Latin American soil altered once they decide to live overseas?"
      }
    ],
