        "@value": "This art talk charts the history of racial politics in Brazil and visual representations of Blackness—from the trans-Atlantic slave trade and whitening campaigns at the turn of the twentieth century to artistic modes of resistance and the founding of São Paulo’s Museu Afro Brasil in 2004."
      }
    ],
