        "@value": "February is BLACK HISTORY MONTH!  - VLACC"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us as we celebrate and learn about Black communities on unceded Coast Salish territories!In celebration of Black History Month, we invite you to an exciting, diverse programming at Britannia Britannia Community Services Centre on Thursday, February 15, 2024 at 5:30 pm."
      }
