        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sal Ferreras’s Puerto Rico: Roots and Rhythms | November 4 - VLACC"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sal Ferreras’s Puerto Rico: Roots and Rhythms is an all-star tribute to Puerto Rican dance and music, led by veteran performer Sal Ferreras. The concert will feature various Puerto Rican songs with music from other places, performed by a ten-piece band joined by singers and dancers."
      }
    ],
