    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us in this vibrant fusion of cultures with on Saturday, April 6 at 2:15 pm at New Works - Studio B for our workshop exploring the Latin American connections in Flamenco.This class is tailored for anyone who wants to know more about the Flamenco's Latin American connections, Ida y Vuelta (“coming and going”) song forms such as Rumba, Tango, Guajira, Petenera, and Vidalita."
      }
    ],
