        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Open Doors to Art: Studio Visit with Yaimel López - VLACC"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us for this special online Studio Visit and art talk with Vancouver-based artist Yaimel López. Do you ever wonder what an artist studio looks like? How artworks are selected to be a part of an exhibition? What type of art are Latin Americans making today?"
      }
    ],
